{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvVGV0c3VvJTIwVGhlJTIwSXJvbiUyME1hbiUyMCUyODE5ODglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Tetsuo The Iron Man","description":"A \"metal fetishist\", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he's made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.\n\nRated NR · Released 1 Jul 1989 · Japan · Language: Japanese · 67 min\nStudio: Kaijyu Theater\n\nOn your server — Audio: Japanese","releaseInfo":"1988","genres":["Horror","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lARc59hUAKW3ziWddftUnZ99R8c.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sZ40CNVFVNFwANLQO0l1GuBPbRG.jpg","imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"67 min","cast":["Tomorowo Taguchi","Shinya Tsukamoto","Kei Fujiwara","Nobu Kanaoka","Naomasa Musaka","Renji Ishibashi"],"director":["Shinya Tsukamoto"],"released":"1989-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Metal invades the flesh. Murder consumes the mind.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shinya Tsukamoto","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hV6xjse7zDkjyRIyp8Wcb7VXgdH.jpg"},{"name":"Tomorowo Taguchi","character":"Salaryman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8dyNOaOW9c9Qy2itA4haxJT4TN6.jpg"},{"name":"Shinya Tsukamoto","character":"Metal Fetishist","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hV6xjse7zDkjyRIyp8Wcb7VXgdH.jpg"},{"name":"Kei Fujiwara","character":"Girlfriend","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rmBIFTChP8HFIrVeAXuY95KOZsl.jpg"},{"name":"Nobu Kanaoka","character":"Woman in Glasses","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5sAkS5scWe6MLl7eQr0p9S9NyD2.jpg"},{"name":"Naomasa Musaka","character":"Doctor","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185